### 1. List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 2. List books with filter and limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### 3. Read one book (found: 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 4. Read one book (not found: 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 5. Create a new book (201 Created + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pro Spring 6",
  "author": "Cosmina",
  "year": 2023
}

### 6. Replace a book (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java (3rd Edition)",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}

### 7. Delete a book (first time: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 8. Delete a book (second time: 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 9. Task 4: Post/Redirect/Get (Form submit)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java+Precisely&author=Sestoft&year=2016

### 10. Status code experiment: 400 Bad Request (TypeMismatchException)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/abc

### 11. Status code experiment: 404 Not Found (No handler mapping)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 12. Status code experiment: 405 Method Not Allowed (DELETE not allowed on /api/books)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 13. Status code experiment: 415 Unsupported Media Type (text/plain not supported for @RequestBody)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello Spring

### 14. Status code experiment: 406 Not Acceptable (Accept: application/xml not supported)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/xml

### 15. Individual Variant 2: Valid 4-digit year (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/2018

### 16. Individual Variant 2: Invalid year regex (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/99
